{
  "about": "The first move: the initial position with all twenty legal moves, rated, and the fourteen positions the book does not follow, each with its name and background (root.en.json, root.de.json). The six moves rated 4 and 5 are followed, and the positions they reach are declared in their own modules under lines/, which also hold the replies; the strategy text of each first move stays here, with the move. The ratings are the maintainer's, settled on 2026-10-23; the backgrounds were checked against the sources listed, read the same day (docs/product-specs/opening-explorer.md, The database). The named lines below it (src/content/named/) are folded in where they fit (docs/adr/0002-opening-modules-folded-to-a-size-budget.md).",
